<title>HONG KONG: Morgan sets warrants on Hang Seng Bank.</title>
<headline>Morgan sets warrants on Hang Seng Bank.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd said it launched 31.5 million American-style warrants on shares of Hang Seng Bank Ltd on Monday.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE   HK$81.225	 PREMIUM	   7.76 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE    HK$1.6028	 GEARING	   5.6X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION     14.OCT.97	 SETTLEMENT DATE 4.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	  HONG KONG	 MIN EXER LOT    1,000</p>
<p> LISTING DATE   7.NOV.96	  SPOT REFERENCE  HK$90.25</p>
<p> NOTES	    GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>REUTER</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
